{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國《衛報》周三（14日）報道，英國商業及貿易大臣韋諾韜表示，儘管英國面對政治壓力，被要求配合歐盟政策，以換取日後建立更緊密的經貿關係，政府不會屈服於其他國家的要求，向中國汽車徵收進口關稅。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.580977+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:28:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.255223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416450+00:00","content_hash":"b57e05450f22d41d9d312bc70942831ecd38c895ac00516a65f131281aa82458","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}